  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "ABOUT SAND SEAIR:<br>Welcome to Sand Seair, a newly decorated beach home, with upgraded furnishings and renovated outdoor pool area perfect for large families looking to get away from it all. Relax at the beach all day and then unwind around the newly updated pool deck in the afternoon. Sand Seair is a 5-bedroom 4.5-bathroom home, located in Inlet Beach, sleeping up to 18 guests.<br><br>Sand Seair has a private bedroom on the 1st floor with a king-sized bed and full bathroom. The first-floor bedroom has private access to the newly updated pool/spa and pool deck. On the second floor is the main entrance to the home, formal dining area, living room, spacious kitchen and casual dining space. The master bedroom, located on the third floor, has a king bed and large private bath with a walk-in shower and separate soaking tub. Down the hall, on the 3rd floor, is a large kid's room with 2 custom built sets of full-size bunk beds! The bunk room can comfortably sleep up to 8 children. The 4th bedroom, located on the third floor, has a King bed with a large balcony and gulf views. The fifth bedroom is located in the carriage house, connected to the main house by balcony, and includes a queen bed, sleeper sofa, kitchenette, and full bathroom. The carriage house can be accessed separately via the private entrance on the first floor next to the pool. Sand Seair has been updated beautifully with a focus on entertaining the entire family around the pool, updated pool deck, and 5 balconies.<br><br>ABOUT THE AREA:<br>Inlet Beach is a charming beach neighborhood located along Florida's scenic Highway 30A. Known for its stunning white sandy beaches, crystal-clear waters, and relaxed atmosphere, Inlet Beach offers a peaceful coastal getaway for visitors seeking a more laid-back vacation experience. This quaint community is characterized by its quiet residential streets lined with beautiful beach cottages and upscale vacation homes, perfect for those looking to unwind and enjoy the natural beauty of the Gulf Coast.<br><br>When you stay in Inlet Beach you are never far from the beach, or a magnificent view. To explore 30A, take a bike ride to Rosemary Beach to enjoy the farmers market, discover the new 30A Avenue shops, taste the fine local cuisine, and visit local businesses along 30A. Visitors can also explore the neighboring beach communities of Rosemary Beach, Seacrest Beach, and Alys Beach, each offering unique shopping, dining, and entertainment options. For additional shopping and adventure, take a family drive to Pier Park in Panama City Beach or travel to the Sandestin Outlet shops. <br><br>Inlet Beach provides easy access to a variety of outdoor activities, including swimming, sunbathing, paddleboarding, kayaking, and fishing. The nearby Camp Helen State Park offers nature trails for hiking and birdwatching, while Lake Powell - one of Florida's largest coastal dune lakes - provides opportunities for boating and wildlife viewing.<br><br>With its pristine beaches, serene ambiance, and proximity to a wealth of recreational opportunities, Inlet Beach is a hidden gem along Highway 30A, perfect for those seeking a peaceful retreat on Florida's Gulf Coast.<br><br>BEACH ACCESS:<br>* Wall Street Neighborhood Beach Access<br><br>PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS:<br>* 6-Seater Golf Cart<br>* 4 complimentary bikes<br>* Walk or bike ride to the beach<br>* Pool can be heated for an additional fee<br><br>PARKING:<br>* Free Parking up to 3-4 Vehicles<br><br>PROPERTY RULES:<br>* Must sign rental agreement within 48 hrs of booking or subject to cancellation<br>* Must Be 25 years or older<br>* Optional pool heat: $90 per day.<br><br>ABOUT PARADISE PROPERTIES:<br>When you book your vacation in Florida's Panhandle with Paradise Properties Vacation Rentals and Sales, you can expect first class customer service from the moment you inquire. All of our properties are professionally cleaned, inspected, and maintained at the highest level. We are located close to all of our properties, and we are available 24 hours per day and 7 days per week to ensure your vacation is flawless. Our goal is to build a lasting memory for all of our guests.<br><br>​​​​​​​**Please be aware this area has a lot of development and new construction going on at all times. At any given point, adjacent properties to properties we manage may go under construction without notification. Paradise Properties is not liable for any construction happening outside of the properties we manage.",
